<title>UK: P&amp;O sells Dutch roadtanks unit H&amp;S Transport.</title>
<headline>P&amp;O sells Dutch roadtanks unit H&amp;S Transport.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Peninsular and Oriental Steam Navigation Co said on Friday it sold its majority stake in Dutch roadtanks business H&amp;S Transport Group in a deal valuing the firm at 13 million stg.</p>
<p>P&amp;O said it sold the company to a management-led group.  </p>
<p>Under the deal, P&amp;O will also be able to sell its residual stake in the firm at a later date.</p>
<p>H&amp;S Group, based at Barneveld, in the Netherlands has about 310 staff.</p>
<p>P&amp;O said the sale was part of its plan to reduce its non-core investments. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
